      "title": "MiniMax-H3 Multiframe Reference — read first",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Multiframe Reference (remote MiniMax-H3)\nOne semantic reference plus three timeline guides, adapted from the official ComfyUI Multiframe Reference template for a remote vLLM-Omni server.\n\n- **Anchor 1** → Video References `image_1` (`<Picture 1>`): subject identity and opening composition.\n- **Anchors 2–4** → MiniMax H3 Add Guide at frames **36 / 72 / 120** (1.5 s / 3.0 s / 5.0 s at 24 FPS).\n- Output: 1344×768, 24 FPS, `duration=5.167` → 124 frames (`17k+5`), with generated audio.\n\nGuides are VAE-encoded timeline conditions; they never enter the Qwen reference presentation, so only `<Picture 1>` is a reference tag. Select your own files in the four Load Image nodes (the official sample images are linked in the workflow guide)."
      ]
    },
